codex
The failure is now localized: this container’s inner PID (for example `2`) is not mounted at `/proc/2`, while Lean 4.22 resolves its executable through `/proc/<getpid>/exe`; `/proc/self/exe` works. I’m applying a narrow audit-local preload shim that redirects only numeric `/proc/*/exe` `readlink` calls to `/proc/self/exe`. It does not alter Lean sources, generated files, theorem code, or build outputs, and its source and hash will be retained in evidence.
apply patch
